    ontoksd:hasSpecificationPattern ontoksd:CS2023SpecificationPattern ;
    ontoksd:hasTask cs2023c:Task_Systems6 ;
    rdfs:comment "OntoKSD representation of CS2023 example Systems6. The source record retains the complete, unpaired knowledge-unit and skill-level lists. KnowledgeSkill pairings are explicit local assignments and do not claim that CS2023 specifies those individual bindings. Task elements are an analytical interpretation of the reference task and competence statement."@en ;
