cs2023c:Source_Systems6 a prov:Entity ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Computer Science Curricula 2023, Competency Framework Examples, example Systems6, starting on printed page 402."@en ;
    dcterms:description "Task: Deploy an application component on an operating system/runtime/virtualized operating system/container. Competency statement: Identify and mitigate potential problems with deployment; automate setup of deployment environment; set up monitoring of component execution. Required knowledge: OS-Purpose, OS-Principles, OS-Concurrency, OS-Scheduling, OS-Process, OS-Memory, OS-Protection, AR-Assembly, FPL-Scripting. Required skills: Apply. Desirable professional dispositions: Meticulous, Persistent, Proactive."@en ;
    dcterms:identifier "Systems6" ;
    dcterms:isPartOf cs2023:CS2023Document ;
    dcterms:requires cs2023:KU_AR_Assembly,
